Man, this device is just implemented terribly. Honestly, this looks like it shouldn't have any endpoints at all. But since it only implements `Multilevel Sensor` V2, we can't figure out automatically that it supports temperature and humidity sensors, so that's probably why it has two endpoints. Now if it used proper multi channel encapsulation, this wouldn't be a problem, but it doesn't.

