You'll probably end up with a bunch of unnecessary entities for the endpoints now.

Just copied the existing file to the config directory and added the compat lines.
```
	"compat": {
		// The device shouldn't have any endpoints
		"preserveRootApplicationCCValueIDs": true,
		"preserveEndpoints": []
	}
```
Looks working :-) 
I'm not exactly sure on how the entities have changed,  but I now have one humidity entity and one temperature entity that are updated when the messages from the device come in. Thanks!!

